# Opportunity+ to oUP Integration Guidelines

## Purpose

This rule provides comprehensive guidelines for the Opportunity+ to oneUNOPS Projects (oUP) integration, which synchronizes opportunity data by creating base engagements in the Pre-engagement stage.

## Integration Overview

### What This Integration Does

The integration synchronizes opportunity data from **Opportunity+** to **oneUNOPS Projects (oUP)** by:
1. Creating a base engagement in oUP
2. Moving it to the **Pre-engagement stage**
3. Enabling seamless transition from opportunity identification to formal engagement management

### Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Bi-directional Deep Linking** | Navigate between Opportunity+ and oUP with contextual links |
| **Comprehensive Data Sync** | Transfers 19 categories of data (countries, partners, SDGs, risks, deliverables, stakeholders) |
| **Email Notifications** | Automated alerts when engagements are created or updated |
| **Idempotent Processing** | Safe to run multiple times without data duplication |

