## Message Transport (Google Cloud Pub/Sub)

### Expected Latency

**1-5 minutes** between save in Opportunity+ and engagement creation in oUP

### Message Payload

The Pub/Sub message includes:
- Full XML payload (can be several MB for large opportunities)
- Message metadata (timestamp, message ID)
- Subscription routing information

---

## Data Synchronization Process

### Stored Procedure Location

```
ou-erp/Database/Stored Procedures/dbo.aunops_Integration_OpportunityPlus_Opportunity_Synchronize.sql
```

### Processing Steps

| Step | Action | Output |
|------|--------|--------|
| 1 | Parse XML into temp tables | `#opportunity`, `#countries`, `#funding_partners`, etc. |
| 2 | Resolve user IDs from email addresses | Converts emails to oUP user_id |
| 3 | Check for existing base engagement | Determines if CREATE or UPDATE |
| 4 | Insert/Update opportunity shadow table | `eppm.aunops_opportunity` |
| 5 | Insert countries | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_country` |
| 6 | Insert funding partners | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_funding_partner` |
| 7 | Insert client partners | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_client_partner` |
| 8 | Insert stakeholders | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_stakeholder` |
| 9 | Insert deliverables | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_deliverable` |
| 10 | Insert SDGs | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_sdg` |
| 11 | Insert SDG Targets | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_sdg_target` |
| 12 | Insert SDG Indicators | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_sdg_indicator` |
| 13 | Insert Collaborators | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_collaborator` |
| 14 | Insert UNCF Outcomes | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_uncf_outcome` |
| 15 | Insert UNCF Indicators | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_uncf_indicator` |
| 16 | Insert Risks | `eppm.aunops_opportunity_risk` |
| 17 | **Create/Update Base Engagement** | Calls `eppm.aunops_EngInsert` |
| 18 | Populate engagement relationships | Copy shadow → engagement tables |
| 19 | Create EAC survey responses | Map risks to survey questions |
| 20 | Create engagement risks | Call `eppm.aunops_SurveyRiskInsert` |
| 21 | Send email notification | Notify BD/PE team |

