## Implementation Checklist for Developers

### When Implementing Integration-Related Features

- [ ] Ensure all 19 data categories are properly extracted and mapped
- [ ] Implement idempotent processing (safe for re-runs)
- [ ] Handle user ID resolution from email addresses
- [ ] Create/update logic based on existing engagement check
- [ ] Map high-risk items to survey questions correctly
- [ ] Send appropriate email notifications (create vs update)
- [ ] Implement bi-directional deep links
- [ ] Handle XML payload parsing for all supported elements
- [ ] Log integration events for debugging

### When Testing Integration

- [ ] Verify all mapped fields transfer correctly
- [ ] Confirm unmapped fields are intentionally excluded
- [ ] Test idempotency (run sync multiple times)
- [ ] Validate email notifications sent to correct recipients
- [ ] Check deep links work in both directions
- [ ] Verify high-risk mapping creates risks in oUP
- [ ] Test with large payloads (performance)
- [ ] Confirm 1-5 minute latency expectation

