## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

| Issue | Possible Cause | Resolution |
|-------|----------------|------------|
| Engagement not created | Pub/Sub message not received | Check Pub/Sub subscription and message logs |
| Missing data in engagement | Field not mapped or XML parsing error | Verify field mapping and XML structure |
| Duplicate engagements | Idempotency check failed | Verify `opportunity_id` lookup logic |
| Email not received | Invalid email addresses | Check user email resolution |
| Wrong risk mapping | Risk not tagged as high | Verify risk classification in Opportunity+ |

### Debugging

1. Check stored procedure logs in oUP database
2. Verify Pub/Sub message delivery
3. Review XML payload content
4. Confirm user email → user_id resolution
5. Check engagement shadow tables

